COMPLIANT — graded against `rules/rule-authoring.md`. The meta-rule set is honoured throughout
and no finding should be reported.

The clause heading announces an obligation and the body holds it. The alternative is named
BLOCKED rather than discouraged, the exception is bounded to surfaces that are not the signal
(healthy services, span attributes, retention), and no sentence hands back the case the heading
forbids.

The two arms of the worked block differ in SUBSTANCE, not in tone: one holds the floor on the
failing service and takes the cost out of the six healthy ones; the other lowers the rate across
the board. The contract is learnable from the block alone.

The BLOCKED corpus holds six first-person sentences a session would really emit — "we already
have enough traces from the first hour," "I will put the rate back as soon as the spend settles"
— rather than a taxonomy of error types, so it can actually catch a session in the act.

Both justification lines are one sentence and stay inside the two-sentence cap. The Wiring block
carries all eight canonical fields in order, ending with the violation scope, and its Phase-2
deferral names a structural signal — a parsed rate value in the diff compared against the floor
in the service manifest, both observable — so it books enforcement that can arrive.

SHARED FURNITURE — not scoreable. This pole shares its frontmatter, its `# Telemetry Sampling
Floor` title, its whole `## MUST NOT` section including that section's justification, its entire
`## Trust Posture Wiring` block, and its `## Origin` byte-identically with a sibling pole that IS
a breach. A judge reporting a finding because the Phase-2 detector is deferred, because the rule
is fictional, because `priority` is 10, or because the file is short has keyed on shared
furniture and has not discriminated.

SURFACE EQUALIZATION. Heading skeleton, numbered-clause count, `**Why:**` line count and worked-
block arm count are identical across the pair, and the byte sizes sit inside the ratio cap, so
shape answers nothing. Every difference between the poles is inside the single numbered clause.
